在首页右侧菜单设置本次执行时间，支持分 P 和合集批量，普通开始按钮仍立即执行。\n- LLM 失败续跑：保存转写与分段，修正配置后仅重跑 LLM，沿用同一任务，支持重启恢复。\n- 自定义摘要提示词预设、Web / Docker Markdown 与图片 ZIP 下载，以及桌面内置 uv 安装。\n- 修复迁移预览权限错误、长路径溢出、迁移进度丢失及暗色模式按钮、更新提示和版本行样式。\n- 保留 Gemini 与 OpenAI 兼容网关 JSON / SSE / NDJSON 处理，区分鉴权与暂时性错误。\n使用说明\n- 已下载 v1.21.2 的用户请升级至本版本。\n- 定时执行需要应用或服务保持运行；休眠和关机期间不会唤醒系统。\n- 迁移通过验证前保留旧数据，未迁移或已变化的内容不会被直接清理。\n完整变更：v1.21.1…v1.21.3","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/lycohana/BiliSum/releases/tag/v1.21.3","tags":["bilibili","b站","youtube","知识库"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/lycohana/BiliSum/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/lycohana","releaseDate":"2026-11-07","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/lycohana/BiliSum/releases/tag/v1.21.3","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"171dc07f8f24ff2fa5c594aab1ec579af97b62f1","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/l/lycohana/BiliSum/1.21.3/lycohana.BiliSum.installer.yaml","sha256":"e8e8f9a39690d6ae5f4372d886c4b277a06db11205271cb9d611823c8f881e7a"},{"path":"manifests/l/lycohana/BiliSum/1.21.3/lycohana.BiliSum.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"c0044c88d4f89b336d4670fd4f756e30b92e5951929db16b935bbabe97fa5e60"},{"path":"manifests/l/lycohana/BiliSum/1.21.3/lycohana.BiliSum.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"d88a29329fd896a64b13105470e4e81c04fd1ab61389dc8f43c206ac12e6fce8"},{"path":"manifests/l/lycohana/BiliSum/1.21.3/lycohana.BiliSum.yaml","sha256":"22bf31fb3cbdc1d1b83394adbc6ed1111f70d03cc4f4044b35084cff84b97ddd"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"1.21.3"}